    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Nearly half \n       of the world's population is under the age of 25 . As we discuss the mass implications of COVID-19, it is worthwhile to consider how this pandemic will particularly affect younger generations both in the short and long-term, as the world's future depends on today's youth.",
